---
import CtaButton from './CtaButton.astro';
import { CTA } from '../config';
---

<section
  id="hero"
  class="flex min-h-[80dvh] flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 pb-16 pt-12 md:pt-16"
>
  <div
    class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-center gap-10 md:flex-row md:gap-10 lg:gap-20"
  >
    <div
      class="flex min-w-0 max-w-xl flex-col items-center text-center md:items-start md:text-left"
    >
      <h1
        class="animate-hero-in font-display text-hero-lg font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-on-surface"
        style="--reveal-delay: 0ms"
      >
        Visualiza tus gastos<br />
        <span class="text-primary">y empieza a ahorrar</span>
      </h1>
      <p
        class="animate-hero-in mt-6 text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant sm:text-lg"
        style="--reveal-delay: 90ms"
      >
        MoneyDiary aplica la metodología 50/30/20 a tus gastos reales para
        que visualices claramente a dónde va tu dinero. Entiende tus
        finanzas, identifica oportunidades de ahorro y comienza a generar
        resultados con solo subir tu cartola bancaria.
      </p>
      <div class="animate-hero-in mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row" style="--reveal-delay: 180ms">
        <CtaButton href={CTA.href}>{CTA.label}</CtaButton>
        <CtaButton href="#como-funciona" variant="ghost">
          Ver cómo funciona
        </CtaButton>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="animate-hero-in shrink-0" style="--reveal-delay: 270ms">
      <picture>
        <source srcset="/images/banner-image.webp" type="image/webp" />
        <img
          src="/images/banner-image.png"
          alt="MoneyDiary app dashboard"
          width={1002}
          height={616}
          fetchpriority="high"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
          class="w-full max-w-[500px] md:max-w-[360px] lg:max-w-[600px]"
        />
      </picture>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
